## Known confirmed rules

### Crafting
- Resource Saver I = +10%
- Resource Saver II = +15%
- Resource Saver III = +20%
- Resource saver is additive
- deterministic planning interpretation
- example: +45% saver ⇒ 100 crafts yields 145 effective outputs

### Crafting overflow
- blocked crafted output is not received
- resources are refunded
- blocked crafted output does not grant crafted-item mastery

### Mastery bonuses
- Mushroom Stew = +10% mastery for 5 minutes
- applies broadly to mastery
- event mastery bonuses may exist and are variable
- event resource saver bonuses may exist and are variable

### Apple Cider
- baseline: 1010 explores
- requires at least 1010 stamina
- costs 40 apples to craft
- sets drop behavior to 0.40

### Cinnamon Sticks
- cider explores +25%
- baseline becomes 1263
- EE scaling becomes 12.5 explores per point, rounded

### EE
- affects cider only
- not Lemonade/AP

### Lemonade
- base: 10 items
- with Lemon Squeezer: 20 items

### Arnold Palmer
- recipe: 1 Iced Tea + 20 Lemonade
- requires Crafting 92
- base: 200 items
- with Lemon Squeezer: 500 items

### AP modifiers
- Quandary Chowder: +10% AP/Lemonade effectiveness
- Lemon Seltzer: +50% AP items for 50 uses
- Lemon Cream Pie: throughput / multi-use effect

### Pets
- 1 item per pet level per hour
- each pet can hold up to inventory max of each item
- pets stop producing after 48 hours offline
- seasonal pets only produce during active 2-month windows
- stored seasonal-pet items remain collectible anytime
- Owl level 6+ gives double honey

### Pet modifiers
- Crunchy Omelette: 1.5x pet quantity
- Mushroom Stew: mastery multiplier on pet-derived mastery

