## Availability tiers

Certain source classes, especially Cider, Lemonade, and AP, should be modeled by availability tier.

| Tier | Meaning |
|---|---|
| Owned now | Already in inventory and immediately usable |
| Craftable now | Not yet owned in final form, but craftable immediately from current resources |
| Future craftable | Only producible after future farming/acquisition |

Planning recommendation:
- do not silently combine these into one pool
- report them separately when useful

