## Pet planning split

| Capability | Description | Recommendation |
|---|---|---|
| Stored pet inventory conversion | Immediate mastery from currently stored pet items | Early support |
| Simple future pet production | “x days left” estimates for future accumulation | Later but still relatively early |
| Full pet time planner | Time-aware / cadence-aware forecasting | Much later |

### Pet-specific recommendation
- stored pet inventory should support **manual import parsing**
- future pet production should be reported separately from stored inventory

